WEBVTT

00:00:53.470 --> 00:01:00.180
The little sister's dead, and the brother will soon follow.
They'll be like two peas in a pod in the afterlife.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.890
You killed 100 men? Are you kidding me?

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.100
Everything's your fault.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:12.570
You're right, it's certainly my fault.

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:13.530
What?

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:16.700
-Thanks, baldy.
-What...?

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:20.450
-It's all my fault.
-What?

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.500
That's all it's going to be.

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:26.210
I'm in a bit of a good mood right now.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.210
What?

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:33.510
You're going to find out if that
body count of mine is real or fake...

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.430
whether you like it or not!

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:37.780
Blade of the Immortal

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:51.690
You there, girl.

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:52.940
Yes?

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:54.690
Is that your family's grave?

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:57.900
Yes. It's my father's.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:59.740
What about your mother?

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:02.070
Her whereabouts are unknown.

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:04.700
Sounds like a complex situation.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:08.120
He was killed... right before my eyes.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:11.330
There were 30 of them.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:14.750
After killing my father,
they raped my mother and took off with her.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.380
No wonder...

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:19.670
Who are you?

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:25.390
Yaobikuni. For a few reasons, It's been 800 years since
I started living in this graveyard.

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:29.010
I'm in no mood to be laughing at jokes.

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:32.890
So you took that as a joke?

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:36.110
Anyway, what will you do from here, girl?

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:37.900
I'm...

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.940
going to kill every last one of them.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.780
What's so funny?

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:47.990
My apologies, it's our dreams that keep us alive after all.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:51.450
Who knows,
the spirit of Yaya may just grant you your wish.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.250
I'm going to do it.

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:54.870
That's right. My mother...

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.460
might be waiting to be saved somewhere.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.590
Who are these 30 people anyway?

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:03.720
Itto-ryu.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.680
I've heard of them.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:11.520
They're all master swordsmen who butcher
every dojo that defies them.

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:14.020
That's them.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:19.520
They proclaim themselves a swordsmen's dojo,
making them difficult for even the shogunate to handle.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:24.490
They may have been 30 in number when they
attacked your house,

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:27.410
but their influence has grown
more tremendous since then.

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:33.120
Dozens more with unparalleled strength,
and hundreds of disciples below them.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:35.410
How is your skill with a blade?

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.120
It's...

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:39.630
It's nothing compared to my father's, but...

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:42.590
And even he was killed by them, no?

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:46.470
Leave me alone! I may look weak, but I've been training
for nearly two years.

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:52.890
That just won't do. One girl against an entire
outlaw swordsman clan?

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:58.350
Girl, hire a bodyguard!

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:00.610
And hire the very best one.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.730
A bodyguard?

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.490
The Killer of 100.

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:07.400
What...?

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:15.700
TO MISS RIN ASANO
AS THE SAND, AS HAIR OF BLACK, CROSS THE SEA...

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.710
SABATO KUROI

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.380
WANTED

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:31.180
The shogunate is chasing him to this day
but can't catch him.

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:37.520
He had the skill to slay a hundred of his pursuers,
including his little sister's husband.

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:43.320
The man got his own sister caught up in his sword fights

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.860
and ended up killing her.

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:50.030
The task of atonement has been imposed upon him.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:55.040
If you think I'm pulling your leg,
go ahead and seek him out.

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:48.300
You're the only one left.

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:51.050
You bastards.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:54.470
You'll pay...

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:55.600
Sabato Kuroi.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.140
-Yes.
-Wait!

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:01.600
I hear you people once studied
under the same sword school.

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:05.020
There must be a way to resolve this conflict
with our predecessors.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:11.450
Your words... They are interesting.

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:15.160
I wonder what our predecessors would say.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:29.380
The transient ringing bell.
The distressed crying bird.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:33.550
All await their chance to walk the path to the void.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:38.510
The mission of our Itto-ryu is to show the path.

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:41.270
And to make known the weak swordsmen of this realm.

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:45.150
Do what you like with this woman.

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.860
Just leave the daughter untouched.

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:26.770
Are... you going to cut them all like that?

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:32.530
Of course not.

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:39.410
How long have you lived here?

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:42.240
A year and a half.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.500
Sorry, I burnt it.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.970
Did you sleep outside?

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:02.180
I usually sleep in the shed.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.190
You can go ahead and travel alone...

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:18.860
but this place is rife with frogs and bandits.
For a kid like you to be wandering around unarmed...

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:24.540
Thank you. It seems you're not as scary
as the rumors say you are.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.040
You're Mr. Manji, aren't you? The Killer of 100.

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:40.930
I see. You want revenge for your parents.
Sounds like a tall order.

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:43.930
Please help me. I'm begging you!

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.810
You should go while the sun's out.

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:51.730
Of course, I can pay you money up front, Mr. Manji--

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:54.650
Stow it, this isn't about the money.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:11:00.110
Mr. Manji, I heard from Mrs. Yaobikuni.

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:07.620
You're fated to cut down evil-doers as atonement
for the sins of your past.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:27.180
She said there's no way you would turn me down.

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:41.780
Well, in order to accept, I'll need to know just who
was righteous and who was evil.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:47.990
Humans are creatures that often judge themselves
just based on their own vested interests.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:50.040
I don't want to be an accomplice to someone

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:52.750
who acts like they're good putting
on the face of a victim.

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:56.210
If you've done that, you're just another criminal.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.630
But they... My father!

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:02.630
They killed so many people! Right in front of me!

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:05.050
And my mother...

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.760
It was worse than death.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:11.520
I don't even know if she's still alive.

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:15.860
"And we did nothing wrong."
Is that what you're trying to say?

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:23.320
You see, a samurai... If he's a master, he won't
kill someone meaninglessly.

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:28.120
I'm sure it was some personal grudge.
It's just a chain of revenge.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.660
But I... can't take it.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:36.000
I can't live with this. Knowing all of them...

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.500
Such horrible things.

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:42.300
So painful it brings you to tears?

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:54.730
Are you prepared to throw away everything
for your revenge?

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.730
Very well.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:00.030
Then prove it to me right now.

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:00.940
What?

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:05.240
I'm telling you to show me your determination,
if it's really that painful for you.

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:12.750
I will sell myself. Right here and now.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:24.800
Stupid kid. What a joke. Put your clothes on!

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:27.890
Sorry.

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:31.850
You just remind me of my dead little sister.

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:35.270
I meant what I did just now.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:05.220
As the sand, as hair of black, cross the sea

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:12.510
If the butterfly writes its ephemeral sadness
as it parades the sky

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:18.480
Concluding that now is but nostalgia
and dreams

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:22.070
What a beautiful song.

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:25.320
It's called "Of the One That I Love."

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:33.370
This letter... I quite enjoyed reading it.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.950
How embarrassing...

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:37.750
Not at all, you have a wonderful talent for poetry.

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:41.540
Might I as well have your ear for a verse of my own?

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:43.420
Be my guest.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:48.630
Demand a person, the lock yet closed.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:52.600
Demand a person, the doe yet estranged.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:56.180
Tire with my person of old.

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:59.310
The sought light still far away.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.020
Who wrote that?

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:06.360
Inspired by the multiple love letters I received from you,

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:08.280
I wrote them, unskilled as I am.

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:11.070
Magnificent. Like a renowned poet's.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:15.740
I've a long way to go. I can't hold a candle
to the poets of the Heian.

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:21.540
Yet my love letters resemble a piece of
an unstudied sutra.

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:24.250
It was a rather fine composition.

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:28.760
I pray my heart was laid bare within it.

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:31.010
Yes, I got the message.

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.220
I am grateful.

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:38.600
Now, if you'll excuse me, I will cut you down.

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:45.440
My love aims for the ultimate. The ultimate affection,
in other words, death.

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:50.150
That path can repel the intervention of any human.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:56.580
Your hair, your eyes... All those beautiful things...

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:59.540
I want to have all of them to myself, inside me.

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.580
I'm truly honored by your praise.

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.080
The truth is,

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:07.420
I too have come here to take your life.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:10.050
What? How perfect.

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:14.050
Then let us go hand in hand and pay our respects
at Yomotsu Hirasaka.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:16.510
No, I've come all this way.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:18.310
The one to pay their respects will be...

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.230
you alone.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:28.070
You have some nerve to send those things to the dojo
every day for two years.

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:32.900
I despise that hook-eyed man as well,
but you are the one most deserving of my malice.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:36.240
The first to die shall be you
who struck down my father.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:40.950
How beautiful. Like an angel.

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:56.220
That love letter was a real shocker.

00:16:56.300 --> 00:17:00.140
Were those things seriously addressed to you?

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:03.440
Very nice. They left me mesmerized.

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:07.690
You're going after a girl who's young enough
to be your daughter.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.860
Well, thanks to that, you saved me the trouble
of searching for you.

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:12.280
I can handle this!

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:18.700
Just stand back. The swordsmanship of a master
who wields two swords is to an amateur's

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:20.490
what a dragon is to a water flea.

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:28.080
So, they call you Sabato Kuroi? There wouldn't be any
tension fighting against a child, would there?

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:34.090
How about the two of us shades bring down
a rain of blood with our multiple swords.

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:39.350
Miss Rin! No matter how many times I hear it,
it has that adorable ring.

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:44.230
-Truly, the name reflects the vessel.
-You bastard, don't act like you didn't--

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:54.440
You're in the way, young one. This is
an important scene. Can't you tell by looking?

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:58.700
I do not wish to speak to a man.
Now die already.

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:09.210
Sorry about that annoying interruption, Miss Rin.
Let us finally share the proof of our affection.

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:12.920
No need to worry. I will follow after you shortly.

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:16.840
Perform, Golden Bugs!

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:21.350
Well done!

00:18:21.430 --> 00:18:27.560
It has been quite some time since my head
and shoulders were out in the open, Miss Rin.

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:31.860
It's nothing to be so afraid of.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:35.570
Rather than see the women I love grow to be repulsive,

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:39.160
I prefer to have them stuffed and keep them
close by at all times.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:41.320
Wouldn't you?

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:46.830
This one used to be my wife long ago.

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:50.290
She was a beauty with a rather strong mind.

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:52.380
And this one...

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.300
That's...

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:58.260
Indeed.

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:03.930
She was your mother up until two years ago.

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:09.560
Those brutes were cruel to the utmost
in their recreation with her.

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:11.440
I thought it selfish of me...

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:15.940
but immediately realized that this is the path
people should follow.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.990
Do you intend to harm your mother?

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:31.080
You attempted to kill me, didn't you, Miss Rin?

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:34.750
I am always prepared for that fate. First, however...

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:41.760
my final dream is to see you die a beautiful death.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:45.720
Once that happens, I will sever the head of my old love,

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:51.060
and by my blade, let mother and child
return to the good old days.

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:59.360
Then finally, with the help of an acquaintance,
I will have both you and me stuffed.

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:02.610
Our three souls will then converge.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:06.530
Then I can cherish you completely,
even in the eternal realm.

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:10.000
I'll say it once more.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:13.420
This is the proof of my ultimate love.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:17.090
If I die...

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:23.800
Indeed. Then I, whom you despise, will die as well.
You seem to have an understanding.

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:29.430
Will you keep your promise?

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:34.560
I too am a samurai. Once I've seen you off,
I swear it.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:53.790
Father...

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:55.960
Mother...

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:58.130
Here I come.

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:19.230
You! How? With that blood loss...
Are you human?

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:22.240
It hurts. You surprised me.

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:25.910
So I must be human!

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:30.200
You taking your own head is selfish enough
to begin with.

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:35.830
You can't just take someone else's woman
because you want to! You perverted ogre!

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:42.460
I truly am fated to a life of swinging my sword
only out of resentment or grudge!

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:46.300
You can at least die so consider yourself lucky!

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:04.440
You idiot.

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:07.530
-What?
-This revenge of yours...

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:12.160
Would you really be satisfied committing
a double suicide with some underling, eh?

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:14.370
Stupid kid...

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:16.500
You got caught in his traps.

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:18.960
I'm sorry.

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:22.800
As long as you get it. More importantly...

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:25.090
go grab my leg for me.

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:26.470
You need a doctor!

00:22:27.220 --> 00:22:29.720
It's fine, I won't die.

00:22:31.430 --> 00:22:33.600
I can't die.

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:39.440
Sacred bloodworms?

00:22:39.520 --> 00:22:41.060
They're the seed of immortality.

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:44.690
My parents and their pupils have all died.

00:22:44.780 --> 00:22:49.360
If you don't inherit it, the Muten Ichi-ryu
will fade into non-existence.

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:56.120
But we can't spread ourselves too thin
worrying about that stuff.

00:22:56.540 --> 00:22:59.790
After seeing that pervert ogre's skill...

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:02.290
The Itto-ryu aren't kidding around.

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:07.380
I know... No, now I understand.

00:23:07.470 --> 00:23:08.590
Besides,

00:23:08.970 --> 00:23:11.050
you've sold your body to me.

00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:15.560
Though at the moment you're just
a little tenderfoot.

00:23:17.100 --> 00:23:21.100
I guess in four years you might have
gained some worth.

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:23.230
Mr. Manji...?

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:54.850
Act One – Meeting
